  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Sorry, I know this seems a bit rude, but I hope you\ncan forgive me for not turning to speak to you.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I threw out my back. I think I may have a slipped\ndisc or something...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It hurts too bad to move. Even trying to shout\nhurts, so I haven’t been able to call for help...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The last time this happened, I was able to fix my\nback thanks to a certain Pokémon move.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I think it was called...<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Octolock<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020007400680069006E006B0020006900740020007700610073002000630061006C006C00650064002E002E002E00100002FF000006004F00630074006F006C006F0063006B00100002FF000000003F00100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I hate to ask, but do you think you could hit me\nwith a good Octolock?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIt’s a move that the Pokémon <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Grapploct<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> can know.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’re...my only hope...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F0075201900720065002E002E002E006D00790020006F006E006C007900200068006F00700065002E002E002E00100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please...you’ve got to unleash <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Grapploct<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>’s move\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Octolock<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> on me...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "AHHHHHH!!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100480048004800480048004800210021002100100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "THE PAIN! THE PAIN!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054004800450020005000410049004E002100200054004800450020005000410049004E002100100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wait...I feel as if that loosened something up...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006100690074002E002E002E00490020006600650065006C002000610073002000690066002000740068006100740020006C006F006F00730065006E0065006400200073006F006D0065007400680069006E0067002000750070002E002E002E00100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Perhaps Octolock works all the places around the\npain’s source...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500065007200680061007000730020004F00630074006F006C006F0063006B00200077006F0072006B007300200061006C006C002000740068006500200070006C0061006300650073002000610072006F0075006E00640020007400680065000A007000610069006E2019007300200073006F0075007200630065002E002E002E00100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My thrown-out back is hurting less and less now,\nthanks to that Octolock.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Boy, what a lifesaver that was! And you—you’re so\nkind to help out a stranger!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Of course, that Octolock has some real power.\nMight even hurt more than the back pain did.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But I’m still grateful! Thanks, Grapploct! You\ncertainly pack one powerful Octolock...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But I’m still grateful! Thanks, Grapp— Oops, nope.\nI mean to say: Thanks, Malamar!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYou certainly pack one powerful Octolock...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 134
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The thing about a thrown-out back is there’s no\nreal preparing for it.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It just hits, and suddenly you can’t move.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900740020006A00750073007400200068006900740073002C00200061006E0064002000730075006400640065006E006C007900200079006F0075002000630061006E201900740020006D006F00760065002E00100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You should live life to the fullest and enjoy the\ntime—and mobility—you’ve got!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    }
